---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { u } from '../lib/url';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Career at New Afro"
  eyebrow="Career"
  description="Join the cultural and art-scene bridge through internships, volunteering, and future roles with New Afro."
>
  <p>
    At New Afro, we promote art by creatives with African backgrounds and
    support fair cultural exchange. If you are passionate about art,
    intercultural work, creative industries, and connecting cultural scenes, we
    welcome you to explore internships, volunteering, and future job
    opportunities with us.
  </p>

  <h2>Internships</h2>
  <p>
    New Afro is looking for 2-3 month trainees to support the development of
    cultural and creative projects. We welcome students or recent graduates
    interested in creative industries management, cultural marketing, creative
    direction, or curatorial assistance.
  </p>
  <p>
    Trainees contribute to artistic projects, communication strategies, and
    international collaborations connecting African and European creative
    ecosystems. Fluency in English and German is required; additional
    languages are a plus. The internship is mostly remote and offers hands-on
    experience at the intersection of contemporary art, cultural production,
    and creative entrepreneurship.
  </p>

  <h2>Volunteer</h2>
  <p>
    We are looking for enthusiastic volunteers to help organise and run New
    Afro events. Your support helps bring exhibitions, pop-ups, and community
    programmes to life.
  </p>

  <h2>Jobs</h2>
  <p>
    There are no open job offers right now, but we encourage you to stay
    connected and check back as the programme grows.
  </p>

  <p>
    For inquiries about internships, volunteering, or future roles, write to
    <a href="mailto:hello@newafro.net">hello@newafro.net</a>.
  </p>

  <p>
    <a class="na-btn" href={u('/contact')}>Contact us</a>
  </p>
</PageLayout>
